<urn:atm:triage:finding/CPR-022>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "CPR-022" ;
  triage:title "BA.3 intra-doc contradiction: the Runtime table specifies a Hold arm the dispose table does not contain" ;
  triage:description "Hostile closure review (general-purpose opus, task af4edaf6699568f49) @ 9f5aef2fe. BA.3 intra-doc contradiction: the Runtime table specifies a Hold arm the dispose table does not contain. Doc says: BA.3's Runtime table specifies Hold('no delivery channel'); the design's dispose table enumerates exactly 12 arms and has no such arm. Code does: dispose (herdr_task_disposition.rs:42-76) has no no-delivery-channel arm; the behaviour is a post-dispose warn inside the Nudge arm. Recommendation: Correct the BA.3 Runtime table to describe the post-dispose warn, not a dispose arm." ;
